<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 13 bln levs 8- and 14-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 13 bln levs 8- and 14-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed two special discount T-bill issues with maturities of eight and 14 days, yielding 4.06 percent and 7.87 percent to maturity, respectively, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice, the central bank did not say with which financial institution or institutions the issues were placed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3015597001	 BG3015697009</p>
<p> Term			    eight days	   14 days</p>
<p> Auction date		  February 13, 1997  February 13, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date		    February 13, 1997  February 13, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		 February 21, 1997  February 27, 1997</p>
<p> Par value		     6,500 million levs     6,500 million levs</p>
<p> Accepted price		96.10 pct	    92.70 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     4.06 pct	     7.87 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
